WEBVTT

00:13:28.475 --> 00:13:30.977
I played a personal role
in selecting the sponsors

00:13:31.001 --> 00:13:32.200
for this podcast,

00:13:32.224 --> 00:13:34.849
because they all have interesting
cultures of their own.

00:13:34.873 --> 00:13:37.878
Today, we're going inside
the workplace at Accenture.

00:13:37.902 --> 00:13:44.136
(Music)

00:13:53.556 --> 00:13:55.480
Gonzalo Adriazola: I'm from Arequipa,

00:13:55.504 --> 00:13:58.497
which is the second largest city in Peru.

00:13:59.422 --> 00:14:01.491
We have the coast, we have the Andes